flowchart TD
    %% Sources: prope_source_of_truth.md S8/P2; business-analysis.md FR-10. Deferred feature; entry and merge/link details are TBD.

    start([Start: user adds or searches for a prompt])
    entry{Trigger}
    check["[TBD Screen] Similar Prompt Check"]
    match{Similar prompt found?}
    none[No Similar Prompt Warning]
    warning[Similar Prompt Warning and Suggestions]
    action{User choice}
    existing[Existing Prompt Detail]
    continue[Continue New Registration]
    merge["[TBD Screen] Merge or Link"]
    merge_end([End: merge or link behavior Unverified / TBD])
    reuse_end([End: existing prompt reused])
    continue_end([End: registration continues without auto-merge])

    start --> entry
    entry -->|During add or import| check
    entry -->|During Registry search| check
    check --> match
    match -->|No| none
    none -->|Continue| continue
    match -->|Yes| warning
    warning --> action
    action -->|Open suggestion| existing
    existing -->|Reuse existing prompt| reuse_end
    action -->|Keep new prompt| continue
    continue --> continue_end
    action -->|Merge or link| merge
    merge --> merge_end
